                                "sense_id": "f3722a5e-a534-36f5-8c71-dd1ed3064b0b",
                                "text": "Wally Szalla was the least discomforting of men, nothing like the pushy arrogant guys I was always meeting, or who were always meeting me. Guys with names like Dale, Brock, Kevin, Kyle. Guys with names nothing like Wally."
